[{"block_index": 0, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 0, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 1", "text": "혼합골재 규격서"}, {"block_index": 1, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 3, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 4", "text": "1. 적용범위 및 분류"}, {"block_index": 2, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 4, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 5", "text": "1.1 적용범위"}, {"block_index": 3, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 6, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 7", "text": "이 규격은 도로공사에 사용되는 보조기층 등의 도로포설용 골재를 생산하기 위하여 천연 원석을 가공한 부순돌, 토사, 모래등을 혼합하여 제조하는 혼합골재에 대하여 규정한다. 순환골재, 재활용골재, 재생골재 등은 제외한다"}, {"block_index": 4, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 8, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 9", "text": "1.2 분류"}, {"block_index": 5, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 9, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 10", "text": "품명세부품명규 격 명용 도도로포설용혼합골재혼합골재40mm이하ex)보조기층"}, {"block_index": 6, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 10, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 11", "text": "품명"}, {"block_index": 7, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 11, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 12", "text": "세부품명"}, {"block_index": 8, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 12, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 13", "text": "규 격 명"}, {"block_index": 9, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 13, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 14", "text": "용 도"}, {"block_index": 10, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 14, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 15", "text": "도로포설용"}, {"block_index": 11, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 15, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 16", "text": "혼합골재"}, {"block_index": 12, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 16, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 17", "text": "혼합골재"}, {"block_index": 13, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 17, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 18", "text": "40mm이하"}, {"block_index": 14, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 18, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 19", "text": "ex)보조기층"}, {"block_index": 15, "section_index": 0, "parag