대한 미세물질(유해점토, 먼 지 등)을 제외한 부분의 용적비율을 의미하며, 시험방법은 KS F 2340에 규정하는 방법에 따른다."}, {"block_index": 219, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 239, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 240", "text": "5. 검사"}, {"block_index": 220, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 241, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 242", "text": "5.1 검사"}, {"block_index": 221, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 242, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 243", "text": "5.1.1 시료의 채취방법"}, {"block_index": 222, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 243, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 244", "text": "단체표준(혼합골재 - SPS-KAQC-001-7215)에 의한다."}, {"block_index": 223, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 244, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 245", "text": "5.1.2 검사방법"}, {"block_index": 224, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 245, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 246", "text": "검사는 단체표준(혼합골재 - SPS-KAQC-001-7215)에 따라 시험하여 전 항목이 5.2항(품질기준)에 적합하면 그 로트는 합격으로 한다."}, {"block_index": 225, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 247, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 248", "text": "5.2 품질기준"}, {"block_index": 226, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 248, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 249", "text": "가. 일반적성질"}, {"block_index": 227, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 249, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 250", "text": "1) 재료의 외형이 비교적 균일한 형상을 가지고 있어야 한다."}, {"block_index": 228, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 250, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 251", "text": "2) 깨끗하고, 강하고, 내구적이며 부드러운 또는 부스러지기 쉬운 돌 조각 을 함유해서는 안되다."}, {"block_index": 229, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 251, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 252", "text": "3) 먼지, 흙, 점토질, 실트, 유기불순물, 기타 유해물을 함유하지 않은 비 동결 재료이어야 한다."}, {"block_index": 230, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 253, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 254", "text": "나. 물리적성질은 표3에 적합해야 한다."}, {"block_index": 231, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 255, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 256", "text": "표3 - 품질기준"}, {"block_index": 232, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 256, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 257", "text": "종별액성한계소성지수마모감량%수정CBR치%모래당량%보조기층25 이하6 이하50 이하30 이상a25 이상a 시멘트 콘크리트포장의 경우에는 보조기층의 수정 CBR치를 50 이상으로 한다."}, {"block_index": 233, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 257, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 258", "text": "종별"}, {"block_index": 234, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 258, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 259", "text": "액성한계"}, {"block_index": 235, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 259, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 260", "text": "소성지수"}, {"block_index": 236, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 260, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 261", "text": "마모감량"}, {"block_index": 237, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 261, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 262", "text": "%"}, {"block_index": 238, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 262, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 263", "text": "수정CBR치"}, {"block_index": 239, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 263, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 264", "text": "%"}, {"block_index": 240, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 264, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 265", "text": "모래당량"}, {"block_index": 241, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 265, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 266", "text": "%"}, {"block_index": 242, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 266, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 267", "text": "보조기층"}, {"block_index": 243, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 267, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 268", "text": "25 이하"}, {"block_index": 244, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 268, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 269", "text": "6 이하"}, {"block_index": 245, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 269, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 270", "text": "50 이하"}, {"block_index": 246, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 270, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 271", "text": "30 이상a"}, {"block_index": 247, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 271, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 272", "text": "25 이상"}, {"block_index": 248, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 272, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 273", "text": "a 시멘트 콘크리트포장의 경우에는 보조기층의 수정 CBR치를 50 이상으로 한다."}, {"block_index": 249, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 273, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 274", "text": "다. 입도"}, {"block_index": 250, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 274, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 275", "text": "1) 동상방지층에 사용될 재료는 골재의 최대치수가 100mm이하로서 4.76mm체의 통과중량 백분율이 30%∼70%의 범위이고, 0.08mm체통과분이 15%이하인 범위에서 적절한 입도를 유지하여야 한다."}, {"block_index": 251, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 275, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 276", "text": "2) 보조기층재료의 입도는 원칙적으로 표4의 범위 내에 있어야 한다."}, {"block_index": 252, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 277, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 278", "text": "표4 – 보조기층재료의 입도"}, {"block_index": 253, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 279, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 280", "text": "호칭통과중량백분율%75mm50mm40mm20mm5mm2mm0.4mm0.08mmSB-1100-70-10050-9030-6520-555-250-10SB-2-10080-10055-10030-7020-555-300-10"}, {"block_index": 254, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 280, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 281", "text": "호칭"}, {"block_index": 255, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 281, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 282", "text": "통과중량백분율%"}, {"block_index": 256, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 282, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 283", "text": "75mm"}, {"block_index": 257, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 283, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 284", "text": "50mm"}, {"block_index": 258, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 284, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 285", "text": "40mm"}, {"block_index": 259, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 285, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 286", "text": "20mm"}, {"block_index": 260, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 286, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 287", "text": "5mm"}, {"block_index": 261, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 287